      "sourceTextSha256": "89a817a8802bf1b0a65a3556a21bfc263f2d99ead57f91617912d52e01439978",
      "text": "Day 4 · Breakfast, then a full-day group excursion with an English-speaking guide to the Altiplanic Lagoons and the Salar de Atacama. The road to Toconao offers stunning views of the Licancabur volcano; continue to the village of Socaire for a lunch of local dishes, then climb to the Miscanti and Miñiques lagoons, more than 4,000 m above sea level, about 138 km from San Pedro, and the Chaxa lagoon in the salt flat, home to flocks of flamingos. Return to San Pedro de Atacama.",
