      "sourceTextSha256": "b5b47aad4cf34b52d20dfd191ae70015b3069e3377a8ab9a41d1c4508fe29af8",
      "text": "Day 5 · Early check-out at 05:00 for a group excursion with an English-speaking guide to the El Tatio Geysers, 97 km from San Pedro de Atacama at about 4,300 m: one of the largest geyser fields in the world, at its most spectacular at sunrise. Breakfast at the geysers, then a visit to the village of Machuca. Transfer to Calama airport for your flight to Santiago; on arrival, transfer to the hotel.",
